(7635723, 1238760, 103142, '<td valign="top">It must be selective desat month. This is the only shot that does it effectively, imo. I''m still not a desat fan, but I do love the robin and the shadow.</td>', 'It must be selective desat month. This is the only shot that does it effectively, imo. I''m still not a desat fan, but I do love the robin and the shadow.', '2019-07-21 16:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
