(7635843, 1238698, 40391, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by vawendy:</b></div><hr/><i> This is really lovely! I''d love to see notes on how you did this. -10- for creating a photo that''s not my usual cup of tea, but that gets me to stop in my tracks more than any other so far (and I only have 5 photos left on which to vote!) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I use a slow shutter speed and pan on the subject from the passenger seat of a car moving reasonably fast.</td>', 'Originally posted by vawendy: This is really lovely! I''d love to see notes on how you did this. -10- for creating a photo that''s not my usual cup of tea, but that gets me to stop in my tracks more than any other so far (and I only have 5 photos left on which to vote!)   I use a slow shutter speed and pan on the subject from the passenger seat of a car moving reasonably fast.', '2019-07-22 05:28:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(7635844, 1238724, 103142, '<td valign="top">Awesome capture!! I didn''t get a good one of the seagulls chasing the puffin. I had one that was an ok shot, but that''s about it.  It''s a hoot that this many people are going for puffins at the same time. :)<br/> <br/>Huge congrats on the HM!</td>', 'Awesome capture!! I didn''t get a good one of the seagulls chasing the puffin. I had one that was an ok shot, but that''s about it.  It''s a hoot that this many people are going for puffins at the same time. :) Huge congrats on the HM!', '2019-07-22 05:31:53.000000', NULL, 0),
